      "type": "codeCompare",
      "id": "subscription-support",
      "title": "Out-of-the-box subscription support - No additional libraries are needed",
      "descriptionHtml": "<p>Ballerina offers seamless support for GraphQL subscriptions out-of-the-box, eliminating the need for additional libraries like with Apollo. With Ballerina, you can effortlessly integrate systems like Apache Kafka into your GraphQL subscriptions, enhancing real-time data streaming capabilities. This simplifies development, reduces dependencies, and provides a comprehensive solution for building robust GraphQL subscription-based applications.</p>\n",
